        "review_body": "Placed my order using PayPal, and when my order hadn't arrived a week later I called Pearl Source... They had no record of my order, despite having received an order number and already being charged through PayPal.  I was asked to reverse the transaction with PayPal and place my order once more, because I couldn't cite the exact necklace and options to equal the amount I was charged.  The customer service rep I spoke with was very polite, but the company's position and process for handling their own issues was disheartening. Ultimately I did receive the necklace, but wished the \"AAAA\" product was a little... More, for the hassle. ",
