        "owner_reply": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We sincerely appreciate your kind words about our customer service, email communication, and return process. We're truly sorry to hear that your necklace arrived damaged. We understand how disappointing that must have been, especially when opening a piece you had been looking forward to receiving. Please contact us at help@thepearlsource.com so our team can review your order and assist you as quickly as possible.\n\nBest regards,\nThe Pearl Source",
