        "rating_value": 3,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "I hate to write a negative review after experiencing such excellent customer service. The email exchange and return process were pleasant, fast, and easy — truly 10/10. However, upon opening the beautiful box, I was shocked to find a broken $450 necklace. Either a damaged necklace was knowingly packed and shipped, or the quality was so poor that it fell apart inside a secure, well‑made box. It was a disappointing surprise.  ",
