        "owner_reply": "Thank you for taking the time to share such thoughtful feedback. We're delighted to hear your wife loved her gift and that you had a positive experience with our team. We also appreciate you bringing your FedEx delivery experience to our attention. Your feedback is valuable, and we'll be sure to share it with our team. Thank you for taking the time to bring this to our attention.",
