        "report": null,
        "review_body": "To clarify - My experience with the PearlSource representative was fantastic.  Great company.  My wife even cried when she opened the box because she was so happy. I deducted a star to catch the attention of the company reps so they can approach FedEx about their incredibly poor service and delivery.  My two day shipping turned into 4 days (during the business week!) and I was about to contact the local PD to report a suspected theft by one of FedEx’s employees. When I called FedEx to track the package that “no delivery was attempted” I was blatantly lied to that it would be delivered that day (day 3 of 2-day shipping) and rushed off the phone. So to conclude: PearlSource great customer service and pearl quality; Shipping was horrendous.  ",
